      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "dia_graphite",
      "narration": "The same as pencil lead. The difference is how the atoms are arranged.",
      "on_screen_text": "Pencil vs. diamond",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Pencil"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "dia_deep",
      "narration": "Natural diamonds form deep inside the Earth, about a hundred and fifty kilometers down.",
      "on_screen_text": "150 km underground",
      "highlight_words": [
        "150"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "dia_pressure",
      "narration": "There, enormous pressure and over a thousand degrees squeeze the carbon into an incredibly tough network.",
      "on_screen_text": "Pressure and heat",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Pressure"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "dia_age",
      "narration": "Many are between one and three and a half billion years old.",
      "on_screen_text": "Older than dinosaurs",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Older"
      ],
      "sfx": "ding",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "dia_pipe",
      "narration": "They reach the surface in very deep volcanic eruptions that carry them up like an elevator.",
      "on_screen_text": "A volcanic elevator",
      "highlight_words": [
        "elevator"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "dia_hard",
      "narration": "And their atomic network is so strong that a diamond can scratch almost anything.",
      "on_screen_text": "It scratches almost anything",
      "highlight_words": [
        "scratches"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
